{
    "title": "Receipt Pal Scanner & Rewards",
    "description": "Don't just throw out your receipts, earn free rewards & gift cards for them! <font color=\"blue\"><b> Turn receipts into rewards with the ReceiptPal receipt scanner app!</b></font>\r\n\r\nReceiptPal lets you <b>earn valuable gift cards and win cash prizes, just for scanning and submitting your paper receipts and e-receipts, as well as taking surveys.</b> Our receipt scanner app allows you to earn free gift cards from retailers like Amazon, Visa, Walmart, Target, Home Depot, Lowes, and many others just for scanning and submitting your everyday receipts, as well as taking surveys, for market research. Fetch rewards easily and directly from the ReceiptPal app.\r\n\r\nEvery paper receipt and e-receipt will also earn you chances to win cash prizes in our weekly sweepstakes. Three winners will be announced every week. As long as you keep scanning and submitting receipts, you'll be entered automatically! Fetch your receipts and start earning free gift cards today with the ReceiptPal receipt scanner app.\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\n<font color=\"blue\"><b>EARNING REWARDS IS EASY WITH THE RECEIPTPAL RECEIPT SCANNER APP</b></font>\r\n\r\n<b>Earn Points for Scanning Your Paper Receipts</b> \r\nSnap a photo in the Receipts tab to submit your paper receipts. 4 valid receipts fill up one green Point Card.\r\n\r\n<b>Submit Your E-Receipts and Earn Free Rewards & Gift Cards Faster</b>\r\nConnect your email and Amazon accounts to earn even more points. This will help you earn free gift cards and rewards faster by submitting your e-receipts to fill up your green Point Cards.\r\n\r\n<b>Redeem Points for Gift Cards and Win Cash Prizes</b> \r\nEarn 100 points for each completed green Point Card. Redeem your points for free gift cards from great retailers. Additionally, each valid receipt automatically earns you one entry into one of three weekly $250 bonus sweepstakes and to win cash prizes.\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nEarning rewards and free gift cards is easy. Just submit your paper receipts and e-receipts, take surveys, earn points, and then redeem them for valuable rewards and gift cards. You can easily fetch rewards directly from the ReceiptPal app. <font color=\"\u201dblue\u201d\"><b>The more receipts you scan and submit, the more points you earn. Scan receipts every day to maximize your rewards.</b></font>\r\n\r\n<font color=\"\u201dblue\u201d\"><b>Start earning rewards today with the ReceiptPal receipt scanner app and get more out of your receipts! Fetch rewards for your receipts now!</b></font>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Don&#39;t just throw out your receipts, earn free rewards &amp; gift cards for them! <font color=\"blue\"><b> Turn receipts into rewards with the ReceiptPal receipt scanner app!</b></font><br><br>ReceiptPal lets you <b>earn valuable gift cards and win cash prizes, just for scanning and submitting your paper receipts and e-receipts, as well as taking surveys.</b> Our receipt scanner app allows you to earn free gift cards from retailers like Amazon, Visa, Walmart, Target, Home Depot, Lowes, and many others just for scanning and submitting your everyday receipts, as well as taking surveys, for market research. Fetch rewards easily and directly from the ReceiptPal app.<br><br>Every paper receipt and e-receipt will also earn you chances to win cash prizes in our weekly sweepstakes. Three winners will be announced every week. As long as you keep scanning and submitting receipts, you&#39;ll be entered automatically! Fetch your receipts and start earning free gift cards today with the ReceiptPal receipt scanner app.<br><br>--<br><br><font color=\"blue\"><b>EARNING REWARDS IS EASY WITH THE RECEIPTPAL RECEIPT SCANNER APP</b></font><br><br><b>Earn Points for Scanning Your Paper Receipts</b> <br>Snap a photo in the Receipts tab to submit your paper receipts. 4 valid receipts fill up one green Point Card.<br><br><b>Submit Your E-Receipts and Earn Free Rewards &amp; Gift Cards Faster</b><br>Connect your email and Amazon accounts to earn even more points. This will help you earn free gift cards and rewards faster by submitting your e-receipts to fill up your green Point Cards.<br><br><b>Redeem Points for Gift Cards and Win Cash Prizes</b> <br>Earn 100 points for each completed green Point Card. Redeem your points for free gift cards from great retailers. Additionally, each valid receipt automatically earns you one entry into one of three weekly $250 bonus sweepstakes and to win cash prizes.<br><br>--<br><br>Earning rewards and free gift cards is easy. Just submit your paper receipts and e-receipts, take surveys, earn points, and then redeem them for valuable rewards and gift cards. You can easily fetch rewards directly from the ReceiptPal app. <font color=\"\u201dblue\u201d\"><b>The more receipts you scan and submit, the more points you earn. Scan receipts every day to maximize your rewards.</b></font><br><br><font color=\"\u201dblue\u201d\"><b>Start earning rewards today with the ReceiptPal receipt scanner app and get more out of your receipts! Fetch rewards for your receipts now!</b></font>",
